isible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 58px; height: 1px; padding-top: 485px; margin-left: 169px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: center; color: #000000; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#000000, #ffffff); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><code>CloudFront</code></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="198" y="489" fill="light-dark(#000000, #ffffff)" font-family="Helvetica" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">CloudFront</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="zDzkmC1P3IZ_AxIebGVs-88"><g transform="translate(0.5,0.5)"><rect x="2118" y="0" width="540" height="1160" fill="none" stroke="#ff9900" pointer-events="all" style="stroke: light-dark(rgb(255, 153, 0), rgb(175, 87, 0));"/></g><g><g><switch><foreignObject style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;" pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe flex-start; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 538px; height: 1px; padding-top: 10px; margin-left: 2119px;"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0; text-align: center; color: #FF9900; "><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: light-dark(#FF9900, #af5700); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; word-wrap: normal; "><pre dir="ltr" style="color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); font-size: 14px; text-align: left;"><code><span style="color: light-dark(rgb(255, 153, 0), rgb(175, 87, 0)); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; white-space: normal;">Specification:</span><br /><br />Region: ap-southeast-1 (Singapore)<br />Environment: Production design<br />Cluster Type: Amazon EKS — Managed Node Groups<br />Availability Zones: 3 AZs<br />Cluster Count: 1 regional cluster<br /><br />Worker Nodes<br />• Initial baseline: 3 On-Demand worker nodes<br />• Placement: 1 node per AZ<br />• Instance sizing: subject to load testing<br />• Node autoscaling: Cluster Autoscaler<br />• Reserve capacity for an AZ failure<br /><br />Application Availability<br />• Critical stateless services: ≥3 replicas<br />• Spread replicas across AZs and nodes<br />• Readiness and liveness probes<br />• Pod Disruption Budgets for maintenance<br />• Rolling deployments with health checks<br /><br />Scaling<br />• Horizontal Pod Autoscaler for application pods<br />• Scale using CPU and workload metrics<br />• Node autoscaling for pending pods<br />• Validate capacity with one AZ unavailable<br /><br />Networking<br />• VPC: 10.0.0.0/16<br />• Worker nodes in private application subnets<br />• Example AZ-a subnet: 10.0.16.0/20<br />• Unique subnet CIDRs in each AZ<br />• Public HTTPS ingress through ALB<br />• EKS API endpoint: private access<br />• Outbound access: NAT and/or VPC endpoints<br /><br />Dependencies<br />• RDS PostgreSQL: transactional data<br />• ElastiCache Redis: read cache<br />• Amazon ECR: container images<br /><br />Security<br />• ALB protected by AWS WAF<br />• TLS certificate managed by ACM<br />• Application ingress restricted to ALB<br />• Least-privilege workload IAM permissions<br />• Secrets stored in AWS Secrets Manager<br /><br />Observability<br />• Application and infrastructure logs<br />• Monitor p99 latency, errors and request rate<br />• Monitor pod health and resource saturation<br />• Alerts for failures and capacity pressure<br /><br />Performance Targets<br />• 500 requests/second across scoped APIs<br />• API p99 response time &lt;100 ms<br />• Measurement boundary defined in solution<br />